  "defect_type": "missing",
  "message": "The description does not give the plan dimensions (a_mm, b_mm) of the plain laminated elastomeric bearings. It states only \"four internal rubber layers 8 mm thick\", i.e. t1_mm and n_layers. The KG constraint C-02 requires each laminated elastomeric bearing to have complete parameters including plan dimensions, the shape factor rule JTG 3362-2018 clause 8.7 (S = a*b / (2*t1*(a+b))) needs a and b, and there is no rule or default in the knowledge graph that supplies them. Without a and b the bearing shape factor and the bearing shear/vertical stiffnesses (support.<k>.S / .Kv / .Kh) cannot be computed."
